"national interest" includes national defence, national security, public security, the maintenance of essential services and the conduct of international affairs;
"organisation" includes any individual, company, association or body of persons, corporate or unincorporated, whether or not- (a) formed or recognised under the law of Brunei Darussalam; or (bJ resident, or having an office or a place of business, in Brunei Darussalam;
"personal data" means data, whether true or not, about an individual who can be identified - (a) from that data; or (bJ from that data and other information to which the organisation has or is likely to have access;
"prescribed healthcare body", for the purposes of Schedule 2, means a healthcare body declared by the Minister of Health, by notification published in the Gazette;
